WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.815
A speech needs an audience, purpose, selected facts, clear introduction, ordered

00:00:04.815 --> 00:00:06.493
points and effective conclusion.

00:00:07.367 --> 00:00:12.892
What helps a paragraph stay focused? Answer: One central idea with related details.

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:18.180
Present a one-minute speech about reading habits with an opening, two facts and a

00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:18.500
closing.

00:00:19.367 --> 00:00:22.439
Discuss why: A focused paragraph has a clear topic.
